_column et_pb_column_1_5 et_pb_column_8  et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_image et_pb_image_4 et_animated et-waypoint\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"et_pb_image_wrap \"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"126\" height=\"127\" src=\"https://alltak.com.br/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/alltak-adesive-killer-3.jpg\" alt=\"\" title=\"alltak-adesive-killer-3\" class=\"wp-image-64444\" /></span>\n\t\t\t</div><div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_9  et_pb_text_align_center et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\"><p>Pulverize pequena névoa do produto na superfície veicular, em área máxima de 60cm x 60cm.</p></div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div><div class=\"et_pb_column et_pb_column_1_5 et_pb_column_9  et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_image et_pb_image_5 et_animated et-waypoint\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"et_pb_image_wrap \"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"126\" height=\"127\" src=\"https://alltak.com.br/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/alltak-adesive-killer-4.jpg\" alt=\"\" title=\"alltak-adesive-killer-4\" class=\"wp-image-64445\" /></span>\n\t\t\t</div><div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_10  et_pb_text_align_center et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\"><p>Realize o acabamento com auxílio de pano de microfibra limpo e seco, virando-a frequentemente até obter o resultado desejado.</p></div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div><div class=\"et_pb_column et_pb_column_1_5 et_pb_column_10  et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough et-last-child\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_image et_pb_image_6 et_animated et-waypoint\">\n\t\t